y": "Meta", "source": "CNBC", "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/15/apple-meta-partner-ai.html", "date": "15 Oct", "ts": 1792086721.0}, {"quote": "Accelerated computing has transformed the car into an intelligent machine that can understand the world around it … Volvo has spent nearly a century protecting people on the road. …", "leader": "Jensen Huang", "company": "NVIDIA", "source": "NVIDIA Newsroom", "url": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/volvo-cars-and-nvidia-expand-partnership-to-advance-safe-automated-driving", "date": "15 Oct", "ts": 1792085400.0}, {"quote": "Meta has no control or visibility to any of that", "leader": "Alexandr Wang", "company": "Meta", "source": "Axios", "url": "https://www.axios.com/2026/10/15/apple-and-meta-bury-the-hatchet-for-ai", "date": "15 Oct", "ts": 1792083605.0}, {"quote": "It has bugged me that what was my impact of not being there is a lead… helping her out when she was asking for help", "leader": "Satya Nadella", "company": "Microsoft", "source": "Mint", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/companies/news/satya-nadella-recalls-employee-he-failed-to-help-early-in-his-career-i-was-an-absent-leader-barking-orders-11792070800307.html", "date": "15 Oct", "ts": 1792072960.0}, {"quote": "From a data-scarce nation of less than 4 crore 4G customers to a data-abundant nation of 100 crore 4G and 5G customers happened over the last 10 years … Jio is the only player globally with proprietary end-to-end digital connectivity stack.", "leader": "Uday Kotak", "company": "Kotak Mahindra Bank", "source": "Mint", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/companies/news/uday-kotak-in-reliance-jio-ipo-press-conference-historic-issue-ril-to-become-largest-conglomerate-by-market-cap-11792060852077.html", "date": "15 Oct", "ts": 1792060919.0}, {"quote": "It (AI services) is growing at a fantastic pace. If you sort of extrapolate that by a few quarters, you already start to see that's 20-30 per cent of our work in a few quarters, and maybe in two or three years, almost half of our work", "leader": "Salil Parekh", "company": "Infosys", "source": "Mint", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/companies/news/infosys-says-80-000-employees-use-ai-coding-tools-why-is-it-still-hiring-20-000-graduates-11792030468356.html", "date": "15 Oct", "ts": 1792034202.0}, {"quote": "My own sense is it is good news for Infosys, and by sort of that same view, good news for the tech services in India", "leader": "Salil Parekh", "company": "Infosys", "source": "Mint", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/companies/news/infosys-says-80-000-employees-use-ai-coding-tools-why-is-it-still-hiring-20-000-graduates-11792030468356.html", "date": "15 Oct", "ts": 1792034202.0}, {"quote": "Many of the young companies are going through growing pains, and they’re growing incredibly fast. There’s an accountability, responsibility that goes along with building companies that they’re just growing into", "leader": "Jensen Huang", "company": "NVIDIA", "source": "Mint", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/companies/news/will-nvidia-supply-chips-to-develop-unsafe-ai-ceo-jensen-huang-plays-it-safe-it-s-hypothetical-but-11792033835837.html", "date": "15 Oct", "ts": 1792034177.0}], "window_days": 1, "leaders": [{"name": "Sam Altman", "company": "OpenAI"}, {"name": "Greg Brockman", "company": "OpenAI"}, {"name": "Dario Amodei", "company": "Anthropic"}, {"name": "Daniela Amodei", "company": "Anthropic"}, {"name": "Mike Krieger", "company": "Anthropic"}, {"name": "Sundar Pichai", "company": "Google"}, {"name": "Demis Hassabis", "company": "Google DeepMind"}, {"name": "Koray Kavukcuoglu", "company": "Google"}, {"name": "Jensen Huang", "company": "NVIDIA"}, {"name": "Lisa Su", "company": "AMD"}, {"name": "Satya Nadella", "company": "Microsoft"}, {"name": "Mustafa Suleyman", "company": "Microsoft AI"}, {"name": "Kevin Scott", "company": "Microsoft"}, {"name": "Mark Zuckerberg", "company": "Meta"}, {"name": "Alexandr Wang", "company": "Meta"}, {"name": "Liang Wenfeng", "company": "DeepS